  "content": "<h2>Animation, VFX, and Game Industry</h2>\n<p><strong>Talk to mentors:</strong> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vRYveFAl_GuvBo0iuy3EvgPm0fWAGci-Z8e5CZ6hoYz9n8gcoK4dgE0RML-x0pWqRNjGqte-V7phtqB/pubhtml\" title=\"Getting development advice contacts list\">Getting development advice contacts list</a></p>\n<h3>Job Postings</h3>\n<p>Chris Mayne curates what might be the the most comprehensive job posting resource available. See his Google spreadsheet below.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1eR2oAXOuflr8CZeGoz3JTrsgNj3KuefbdXJOmNtjEVM/edit#gid=1392296528\">Animation, VFX, and Game Industry Job Postings curated by Chris Mayne</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.behance.net/joblist?field=3d%20art&amp;country=US\" title=\"Behance Jobs List\">Adobe Behance.net Jobs List</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://s2021.siggraph.org/job-fair/\" title=\"Job fair\">SIGGRAPH 2021 Job Fair</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Conferences</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://s2021.siggraph.org/\" title=\"SIGGRAPH 2021\">SIGGRAPH North America</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sa2020.siggraph.org/en/about-us/siggraph-asia-2021\" title=\"SIGGRAPH Asia 2021\">SIGGRAPH Asia</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://gdconf.com/\" title=\"GDC\">Game Developers Conference (GDC)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.viewconference.it/\" title=\"VIEW Conference\">VIEW Conference (Italy)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Job Resources</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://discover.therookies.co/2019/05/22/job-titles-in-3d-animation-visual-effects-and-what-they-actually-mean/\">Job titles in 3D Animation and VFX</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discover.therookies.co/2019/05/07/the-honest-truth-why-you-are-not-getting-a-job-in-vfx-games-and-animation/\">Why you are not getting a job in VFX, games, and animation</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Magazines and Online Communities</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"http://blender.today\">Blender.today</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://artstation.com\">Art Station</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.behance.net/\">Behance</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://cgsociety.org\">CG Society</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.artofvfx.com/\" title=\"https://www.artofvfx.com/\">https://www.artofvfx.com/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.awn.com/vfxworld\" title=\"https://www.awn.com/vfxworld\">https://www.awn.com/vfxworld</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.awn.com/vfxworld\" title=\"Animation World Network\">Animation World Network</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discover.therookies.co/\">The Rookies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://digitalartlive.com/digital-art-live-magazine/\">Digital Art Live</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blenderart.org/\">BlenderArt.org</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.3dcreativemag.com/\">3D Creative</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.creativebloq.com/imaginefx\">Imagine FX</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.magazinesdirect.com/az-magazines/6936329/3d-world-magazine-subscription.thtml\">3D Artist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.magazinesdirect.com/az-magazines/6936329/3d-world-magazine-subscription.thtml\">3D World</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://shop.3dtotal.com/character-design-quarterly-1year-subscription?\">Character Design Quarterly</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Industry Career Advice</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.artstation.com/mandrin/blog/q2My/feedbacks-how-to-ask-for-them-give-them-and-receive-them-part-1\">Asking for Feedback</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://openvisualfx.com/2019/12/16/my-advice-for-becoming-a-vfx-artist/\">Becoming a VFX artist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discover.therookies.co/2020/12/19/career-advice-working-as-a-3d-fx-artist-with-mattia-rodini/\">Working as a 3D FX Artist with Mattia Rodini</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discover.therookies.co/2020/12/04/career-advice-working-as-a-concept-artist-with-gaelle-seguillon/\">Working as a Concept Artist with Gaëlle Seguillon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discover.therookies.co/2020/11/29/career-advice-working-as-a-3d-animator-with-ian-lade/\">Working as a 3D Animator with Ian Lade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discover.therookies.co/2020/11/18/career-advice-working-as-an-environment-artist-for-a-game-studio-with-enguerrand-michelin/\">Working as an Environment Artist for a Game Studio with Enguerrand Michelin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discover.therookies.co/2020/11/07/career-advice-working-as-a-lighting-td-by-dennis-muller/\">Working as a Lighting TD by Dennis Müller</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discover.therookies.co/2020/10/26/career-advice-working-as-a-character-artist-on-fortnite-at-epic-games/\">Working as a Character Artist on Fortnite at Epic Games</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discover.therookies.co/2020/09/19/career-advice-working-as-a-lead-matte-painter-with-alyssa-zarate-2/\">Working as a CG Supervisor with Laura Hohman</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Contests and Challenges</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://cgboost.com/challenge/\" title=\"https://cgboost.com/challenge/\">https://cgboost.com/challenge/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/digital-art-competition\" title=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/digital-art-competition\">https://www.cgtrader.com/digital-art-competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.artstation.com/contests\" title=\"https://www.artstation.com/contests\">https://www.artstation.com/contests</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://renderman.pixar.com/challenges\" title=\"https://renderman.pixar.com/challenges\">https://renderman.pixar.com/challenges</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.therookies.co/contests\" title=\"https://www.therookies.co/contests\">https://www.therookies.co/contests</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.11secondclub.com/\" title=\"https://www.11secondclub.com/\">https://www.11secondclub.com/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.awn.com/call-entries\" title=\"https://www.awn.com/call-entries\">https://www.awn.com/call-entries</a>ANimation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Themed Entertainment</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tPaYqW5EwEnaMFBwVINe4YV5N7_HQYf9ZwDLRk_YI4w/edit?usp=sharing\">Themed Entertainment and Educational Resources managed by MK Haley</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.teaconnect.org/index.cfm\">Themed Entertainment Association</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Multi-disciplinary and Product Design Resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.dexigner.com/directory/cat/Multidisciplinary-Design/Design-Studios/loc/United-States\">Multidisciplinary Design Studios in the United States</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.core77.com/\" title=\"Core77\">Core77</a> Industrial Design Online Magazine</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Contests and Awards</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://designawards.core77.com/\" title=\"https://designawards.core77.com/\">https://designawards.core77.com/</a></li>\n</ul>\n"
